          "like_count": 1,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "The first commit was 12 June 2024. One repo for the client, one for the server two days later, and a shared rules library so both sides of a match agree on every move.\n\nThe idea: take the Heroes battle screen, drop the map, and put two players on it.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110805506940153982"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T13:54:10.000Z",
