          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "If the unit you want to hit acts before the unit you are sending, the plan is already late. Read the queue before you commit. https://t.co/1eQJpPNHH2",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110730873159168376"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T03:03:53.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2110567307013726582"
